--- stdout
Docs · "change the colours"                                           33 matches

  change the colours
    → tofu settings set theme Nord
  Sub-agents
    → tofu docs agents
  Browser
    → tofu docs browser
  The doctor
    → tofu docs doctor
  The gate
    → tofu docs gate
  Models
    → tofu docs models
  Start here
    → tofu docs start
  Updating tofu
    → tofu docs update
  stop the animations
    → tofu settings set animations off
  show every tool call in the chat
    → tofu settings set chatShowsTools true
  hide the model's thinking
    → tofu settings set showThinking false
  pick the model a sub-agent tier runs
    → tofu settings set modelTier.smart claude-sub/claude-sonnet-5
  change a setting for one project only
    → tofu settings set --scope project <key> <value>
  move old sessions out of the project
    → tofu migrate
  update tofu to the latest release
    → tofu update
  run the next task on another model
    → /models in the app, then pick a model
  always run the orchestrator on one model
    → write model: <source/model> in ~/.tofu/roles/orchestrator.yaml
  see which skills the model is offered
    → tofu run --dir . --show-prompt "anything"
  store the openrouter key the gate needs
    → tofu login openrouter
  work one task with the gate off
    → tofu run --dir . --no-gate "<task>"
  see how full the context window got
    → tofu context
  read the output of a running shell
    → tofu shells log <name>
  check the library files and these pages
    → tofu library
  let the model read the Chrome tabs tofu can reach
    → tofu settings set browser read
  let the model click and type in the tabs tofu can reach
    → tofu settings set browser drive
  take the browser tools away from the model
    → tofu settings set browser off
  let jev pick each browser step toward a whole goal instead of the model
    → tofu settings set browserDriver goal
